      "categoryId": "24",
      "categoryTitle": "Homepage Articles",
      "introtext": "<div class=\"footer-wrapper\">\r\n<div class=\"footer-row footer-content-row\">\r\n<div class=\"footer-content\">\r\n<div class=\"footer-content-column\">\r\n<div class=\"footer-content-inner-column\">\r\n<h2><a href=\"home\">Parish Office Info</a></h2>\r\n<p><a href=\"about/contact-us\">St. Gertrude RC Church</a><br /><a href=\"about/contact-us\">28 School Street,</a><br /><a href=\"about/contact-us\">Bayville, NY 11709</a><br />Telephone: <a href=\"tel:5166281113\">(516) 628-1113</a><br />Fax: (516) 628-9032</p>\r\n<h2>Office Hours</h2>\r\n<p>Monday to Thursday: 9 AM - 4 PM<br />(closed 12 - 12:30 PM for lunch)</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"footer-content-inner-column\">\r\n<h2>Religious Education</h2>\r\n<p>Phone: <a href=\"tel:516622432\">(516) 628-2432</a></p>\r\n<h2>Preschool</h2>\r\n<p>Phone: <a href=\"tel:5166283710\">(516) 628-3710</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"footer-links-column\">\r\n<h2>Links</h2>\r\n<div class=\"inner-links\"><a href=\"about/parish-registration\">Parish Registration</a><a href=\"items/182-how-do-i-plan-a-funeral\">Funeral Information</a><a href=\"https://www.drvc.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Diocese Website</a><a href=\"https://giving.myparishsoft.io//app/giving/FD-83\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Online Giving</a><a href=\"news/bulletin\">Bulletin</a><a href=\"https://bible.usccb.org/daily-bible-reading\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Daily Readings</a><a href=\"https://www.franciscanmedia.org/saint-of-the-day/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Saint of the Day</a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"footer-logo\"><a href=\"home\"><img src=\"images/template/emblem.svg\" alt=\"Footer Logo Emblem\" /></a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"footer-row footer-text-row\">\r\n<p>Contact of visit the rectory for assistance with sacraments, confession appointments,<br />religious education and formation, mass cards, etc. We look forward to connecting<br /> with you!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>",
